{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/b171653fb6a93b8258f35085b0e6aa43.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/b171653fb6a93b8258f35085b0e6aa43.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/b171653fb6a93b8258f35085b0e6aa43.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reincarnation Insurance Company is a post-apocalyptic looter-shooter that blends top-down shooting, Roguelite adventure, and RPG progression.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the elite staff of Reincarnation Insurance Company. In a world ravaged by the Corruption Virus, overrun by zombies, and filled with countless souls trapped in decaying bodies, your mission is clear: \u00a0\u201cexorcise\u201d the zombies, free the imprisoned souls, and guide them back into the cycle of reincarnation\u2014offering a final glimmer of hope for humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/80e9ced86fbe9e307ce0f302c26ec38e.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous souls from history have become emissaries of the divine, ready to support you. Each grants unique combat blessings based on their exceptional talents in life. Evolve your fighting style with every run, becoming stronger with each cycle of reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/468798c1b1ebf87dd00f77a885391c3c.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/468798c1b1ebf87dd00f77a885391c3c.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/468798c1b1ebf87dd00f77a885391c3c.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/377ea443fa56c9ad340dd1045be361ba.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into perilous urban ruins and face hordes of zombies along with bizarre, unpredictable events. Hunt for and customize a vast arsenal of powerful weapons and gear. Every firearm and attachment could be the key to breaking through overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/cd21a01d731862594c4802f3341cfb6e.avif?t=1764665322\" width=904 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/f883e7f884703584ebd3bca50075261b.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the battlefield are temporary mission objectives issued by the Reincarnation Insurance Company. Completing them earns generous rewards and unlocks tactical devices that amplify your exorcism work, making you a force to be reckoned with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/eba1355477ca7fe268e9d497e451a927.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/eba1355477ca7fe268e9d497e451a927.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/eba1355477ca7fe268e9d497e451a927.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/93ad64e103a8abd63e5c05cc8f905c80.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By efficiently clearing zombies and delivering potential clients for the company, you\u2019ll earn precious Contribution Points. These points are the most vital resource in the apocalypse -- Use them to enhance your abilities and acquire the latest gear (they are always worth it) from R&amp;D. Smart investment of your points will cement your status as the company\u2019s most trusted ace operative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/8282dc08ba420aede8528c64bbdfaa7b.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/8282dc08ba420aede8528c64bbdfaa7b.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/8282dc08ba420aede8528c64bbdfaa7b.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your onboarding is complete, weapons are calibrated, and the Reincarnation Agreement is in effect --Welcome to Reincarnation Insurance Company. Work hard, die hard, and rise again!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985950?t=1764665322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985950?t=1764665322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/b541ede2b02c211137e070bc2020db8ccbcdce9f/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1764665322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/b541ede2b02c211137e070bc2020db8ccbcdce9f/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1764665322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4041990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/b171653fb6a93b8258f35085b0e6aa43.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/b171653fb6a93b8258f35085b0e6aa43.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/b171653fb6a93b8258f35085b0e6aa43.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reincarnation Insurance Company is a post-apocalyptic looter-shooter that blends top-down shooting, Roguelite adventure, and RPG progression.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the elite staff of Reincarnation Insurance Company. In a world ravaged by the Corruption Virus, overrun by zombies, and filled with countless souls trapped in decaying bodies, your mission is clear: \u00a0\u201cexorcise\u201d the zombies, free the imprisoned souls, and guide them back into the cycle of reincarnation\u2014offering a final glimmer of hope for humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/80e9ced86fbe9e307ce0f302c26ec38e.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous souls from history have become emissaries of the divine, ready to support you. Each grants unique combat blessings based on their exceptional talents in life. Evolve your fighting style with every run, becoming stronger with each cycle of reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/468798c1b1ebf87dd00f77a885391c3c.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/468798c1b1ebf87dd00f77a885391c3c.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/468798c1b1ebf87dd00f77a885391c3c.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/377ea443fa56c9ad340dd1045be361ba.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into perilous urban ruins and face hordes of zombies along with bizarre, unpredictable events. Hunt for and customize a vast arsenal of powerful weapons and gear. Every firearm and attachment could be the key to breaking through overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/cd21a01d731862594c4802f3341cfb6e.avif?t=1764665322\" width=904 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/f883e7f884703584ebd3bca50075261b.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the battlefield are temporary mission objectives issued by the Reincarnation Insurance Company. Completing them earns generous rewards and unlocks tactical devices that amplify your exorcism work, making you a force to be reckoned with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/eba1355477ca7fe268e9d497e451a927.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/eba1355477ca7fe268e9d497e451a927.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/eba1355477ca7fe268e9d497e451a927.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/93ad64e103a8abd63e5c05cc8f905c80.avif?t=1764665322\" width=660 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By efficiently clearing zombies and delivering potential clients for the company, you\u2019ll earn precious Contribution Points. These points are the most vital resource in the apocalypse -- Use them to enhance your abilities and acquire the latest gear (they are always worth it) from R&amp;D. Smart investment of your points will cement your status as the company\u2019s most trusted ace operative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/8282dc08ba420aede8528c64bbdfaa7b.poster.avif?t=1764665322\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/8282dc08ba420aede8528c64bbdfaa7b.webm?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/extras/8282dc08ba420aede8528c64bbdfaa7b.mp4?t=1764665322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your onboarding is complete, weapons are calibrated, and the Reincarnation Agreement is in effect --Welcome to Reincarnation Insurance Company. Work hard, die hard, and rise again!</p>","developers":["WarmCore Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/4f12f3d428ce760e72b7e7ee616a41b4a537c328/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1764665322","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985950/104411301/ff1b96cc6fe88dd628c343043556424185bfe336/1758854697/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759051303","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985950/104411301/ff1b96cc6fe88dd628c343043556424185bfe336/1758854697/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759051303","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic